RG DS OS: the RG DS Plus's key under the screens reports KEY_HOME instead of BTN_Z (as 0003 for the RG DS)

The Plus's device tree calls it BACK; it is the same ADC key, in the same place, as the RG DS's Home key.

--- a/rk3568-anbernic-rg-ds-plus.dts
+++ b/rk3568-anbernic-rg-ds-plus.dts
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@
 
 		button-back {
 			label = "BACK";
-			linux,code = <BTN_Z>;
+			linux,code = <KEY_HOME>;
 			press-threshold-microvolt = <41000>;
 		};
 	};
